-### Source ablation
-
-- bit除外後のunion
-- overlap点の維持
-- source別bit件数
-- marginal contribution
-
-### Aggregation
-
-- per-BBox→per-video→summary一致
-- percentileとworst-case
-- `NaN` とteacher-invalidの扱い
